Cell["\<\
Encodes the interaction-net copy\[Dash]erase law: erasing one branch of a \
copy leaves a plain wire on the surviving branch.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ea0cfe30-43b1-4d36-be61-5a888a7e7c7f"]
}, Open  ]],

